84,3,Synchronous establishment initialization error protection,Error occurred during communication and servo sync and initialization process.,"Turn off the power once, then re-enter. If error repeats, this might be a failure.
Stop using the products, and replace the motor and the driver. Return the products to the dealer or manufacturer."
85,0,TxPDO assignment error protection,When the data size of the TxPDO map is set up exceeding 32 bytes.,TxPDO data size is set up within 32 bytes.
85,1,RxPDO assignment error protection,When the data size of the RxPDO map is set up exceeding 32 bytes.,RxPDO data size is set up within 32 bytes.
85,2,Lost link error protection,The time set in Pr7.43 elapsed when either Port0 or Port 1 fell and remains in the lost link state after the ESM state transitioned from Init to PreOP.,Check whether there is any problem in wiring of an EtherCAT communication cable.
,,,,Checked whether there is any problem in the communication from higher rank equipment.
85,3,SII EEPROM error protection,"VendorID, Product code, and Revision number do not agree between SII (EEPROM) and the object values.",Check the data of SII.
,,,Reading out from and writing to SII (EEPROM) are improper.,Retry reading out from and writing to SII.
,,,- If any of bit11 to 14 of ESC register 0502h is set to 1.,
87,0,Forced alarm input,Forced alarm input (E-STOP) is applied.,Check the wiring of forced alarm input (E-STOP).
88,0,Main power undervoltage protection(AC insulation detection 2),"Main circuit power supply OFF was detected when the preset value of 6007h (Abort connection option code) is 1 and the PDS state is ¡°Operation Enabled"" or ¡°Quick stop active"".","The capacity rise of power supply voltage. A power supply is changed. The cause by which the magnetic contactor of the main power supply fell is removed, and a power supply is switched on again."
,,,,"Each phase (L1, L2, L3) of a power supply is connected correctly.  The single phase 100V and the single phase 200V should use L1 and L3."
,,,,It replaces with new servo amplifier.
88,1,Control mode setting error protection,"When the preset value of 6060h(Modes of operation) was 0, the PDS state was made to change to ""Operation enabled"".",The preset value of 6060h(Modes of operation) is checked.
,,,When unsupported control mode is set to 6060h(Modes of operation).,
,,," 3(pv), 4(tq), 9(csv) or 10(cst) is set to 6060h (Modes of operation) in the mode of 2 degrees of freedom control.",
88,2,ESM requirements during operation error protection,"When a PDS state was ""Operation enabled"", the ESM state received the changes command to other ESM states.",The change state demand of higher rank equipment is checked.
88,3,Improper operation error protection,When input pin(EXT1/EXT2) of starting probe is not assigned at the time of touch probe setting.,Set up the functional allotment to input pin correctly.
,,,When Z-phase is chosen by trigger selection of a touch probe (60B8h(Touch probe function)) at the time of absolute mode of full-colse.,Set up trigger selection correctly. 
,,,"When the software limit function is enabled, a wraparound occurred to the actual position or command position.",Check the relation between the operation range setting and the software limit setting.
,,,The calculation result of electronic gear ratio fell outside the range of 1000 times to 1/1000 times.,Review the electronic gear settings and turn ON the power again.
,,,"In the calculation process of electronic gear ratio, the denominator or numerator exceeds an unsigned 64-bit size.",
,,,"In the final calculation result of electronic gear ratio, the denominator or numerator exceeds an unsigned 32-bit size.",
91,1,Command error protection,Control mode was switched at intervals shorter than 2 ms.,Check the process of upper device for any problem.
92,1,Feedback scale data recovery error protection,"In the absolute mode , internal position data has not been correctly initialized.",Regulate the power source of the feedback scale to 5VDC ¡¾5% (4.75?5.25V).¡¦Measure the voltage at the  feedback scale connection cable end if it is long.
,,,,"If the motor cable and  feedback scale connection cable are bundled together, separated them."
,,,,Connect the shield to FG.¡¦See the feedback scale connection diagram.
93,0,Parameter setting error protection 1,Manufacturer's use of the parameter setting is incorrect.,Please do not modify the parameter manufacturer's use.
93,3,Feedback scale connection error protection,The communication type of the connected feedback scale (serial communication model) does not match the type selected through Pr3.23 (Feedback scale selection).,Set Pr3.23 (Feedback scale selection) to the type of feedback scale connected.
93,7,Feedback scale connection error protection,Manufacturer's use of the parameter setting is incorrect.,Please do not modify the parameter manufacturer's use.
